# Tips on simple_ml in this folder

Copied from HA05_Multilayer_Perceptron/simple_ml, which is archived and will not be modified;

Added some components like `Perceptron`, `KMeans`, `SoftKMeans`;

Removed some components like `dashboard`, `visualization`;

Fixed: in `Linear`, the shape of X.gradient should be the same as X.shape, or the cascade of `Linear` will fail.

TODO: PCA, (Nonlinear) Autoencoder, SVM (with (Gaussian) Kernal), AdaBoost.
